
# Generated drift output is COMMITTED (FLUTTER_GUIDE.md §7.4) — a fresh clone
# must analyse without running a builder first — but it is not authored, so it
# collapses in a diff and never provokes a merge conflict a human resolves.
*.g.dart linguist-generated=true -diff merge=ours
*.drift.dart linguist-generated=true -diff merge=ours

# gen-l10n output. Committed for the same reason as the drift output — the
# golden lane and every CI job then need no codegen stage, and a fresh clone
# analyses immediately (FLUTTER_GUIDE.md §7.4). Authored text lives in the ARB
# files beside it; these are a projection of those.
app/lib/l10n/gen/*.dart linguist-generated=true -diff merge=ours
